--- !u!114 &1283494750
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1283494748}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb67cf96288f05e4aa7d26c4bfe9298a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueLines
  dialogueText: {fileID: 405810133}
  lines:
  - "Kaylin, you copy? We need to clear this pass. Watch for Wasps\u2014they're all
    over the cliffs."
  - Copy that. I see the swarm, time to clear the road!
  - Whoa, banking hard left!
  - Haha! This handles like a dream!
  - Keep going. Scanners show more movement ahead. Don't leave any behind.
  - Dropping into the trench. Full throttle!
  - Heads up! Rhino Class guarding the crater! He looks heavy.
  - Hang tight! I'm forming up on your wing! Let's take him down together!
  - Look at that armor! My shots are just bouncing off!
  - Nice work, Kay. Vector is locked for orbit. Let's get out of here.
  - Copy that, Liz. Punching it in three, two, one. Gone!
